  <text>
    <body>
      <div type="clause" n="54">
        <head><ref type="lawCode" target="law:Northu">Northu</ref> 54</head>
        <ab type="selectedText" xml:lang="und">Gif friðgeard sy on hwæs lande abuton stan oððe treow oððe wille oððe swilces ænigge fleard, þonne gilde se ðe hit worhte lahsliht, healf Criste healf landrican.</ab>
        <ab type="translation" xml:lang="en">If there is on anyone's land a sanctuary round a stone or a tree or a well or any such nonsense, he who made it is then to pay lahslit, half to Christ and half to the lord of the estate.</ab>
        <ab type="secondTranslation" xml:lang="en">If there is a hallowed space on anyone's property near a stone or a tree or a well or any silliness of this sort, then the one who made it is to pay lahslit: half to Christ, half to the local lord.</ab>
      </div>
    </body>
